title: 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
As I arrive at the classroom, I see NaHyun standing by the door.
{name()}: What are you doing? Aren't you going in?
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: {name()}.
NaHyun: I'm so exhausted today. By any chance...
<<choice 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문 "Sure, I'll text it to you." 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_부1_영문 "Are you seriously asking me for that right now?">>
NaHyun: Could you send me the attendance code later?
===

title: 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +15>>
{name()}: You look really tired. Are you okay?
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: I pulled an all-nighter working on that Data Structures assignment...
NaHyun: Thanks. If you ever want to skip, let me know.
NaHyun: I'll return the favor and send you the code.
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
{name()}: Don't worry about it. Just go get some rest.
(NaHyun looks happy. She waves and disappears in the blink of an eye.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_부1_영문
---
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
{name()}: You're planning to "roll-call-and-run," aren't you?
{name()}: Since you're already here, let's just go in and sit through it together.
<<show hyun_neg2>>
NaHyun: ......
<<play 양나현_허>>
NaHyun: I guess skipping is a bit unethical.
<<show hyun_spec>>
NaHyun: But I'm seriously so sleepy right now......
<<choice 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문 "You really do look exhausted." 주4_목_3교시_강의실_양나현_부1_영문 "Still, the answer is no.">>
(NaHyun's face darkens.)
===